This seed provides the basic components that should be installed on an
Ubuntu-family system (server or desktop) running on Raspberry Pi.

= Hardware and Architecture Support =

 * piboot-try [arm64 armhf]
 * raspi-utils [arm64 armhf]
 * rpi-eeprom [arm64 armhf]
 * wpasupplicant
 * ubuntu-raspi-settings
